# Relationship to Recursive Reasoning

Some observed processes involve:

```text
Recursive Re-entry
Preservation
Constraint
Return
Restabilization
```

and may therefore be structurally comparable with Recursive Reasoning research elsewhere in the Research Program.

However:

```text
Structural Similarity
        ≠
Recursive Reasoning Classification
```

No Recursive Reasoning conclusion is made by this inquiry.

Any such comparison should occur independently.

